# The /catalogue route is force-dynamic and fs.readdir()s public/catalogue at
# runtime, so Next traces the WHOLE directory into that serverless function.
# With every historical flipbook version present (~318 MB) the function blows
# past Vercel's 250 MB limit ("Max serverless function size exceeded").
#
# Only the NEWEST version is ever served (the route auto-detects the highest vNN),
# so exclude the superseded versions from the deploy. They remain in git history.
# When a new version ships, add the previous one here.
public/catalogue/v30/
public/catalogue/v34/
public/catalogue/v41/
public/catalogue/v42/
public/catalogue/v43/
public/catalogue/v44/
public/catalogue/v50/
public/catalogue/v51/
public/catalogue/v52/
public/catalogue/v53/
